{"title":"1994 IMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the set of real numbers strictly greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />.  Find all functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/2/2f2d436be3e4977ddba9bdf67a9e8e6db508a44e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:S \\to S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" /> satisfying the two conditions:\n</p><p>1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e493e1c377107c62922ae655c978acffaed15dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+f(y)+xf(y)) = y+f(x)+yf(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"320\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />;\n</p><p>2. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/2/ed204d61675fd60a9f58e0ee455ae4e146b8dfb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{f(x)}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"41\" height=\"40\" /> is strictly increasing on each of the intervals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/8/7e8c38956f2f71b857265a5b7b4168a070ac5577.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1&lt;x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/b/28b30adeb3fd46044e00e82156ec3765c411dadd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The only solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/9/429c9c2770acd6929f7ab1859edc65660d347ebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\frac{-x}{x+1}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"112\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a7888da2fab10f8ec0b87127f80f9bf5e7a69a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"11\" /> we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/f/06f87828d6a0a240f8b4649cc77f5b30e19da733.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x+f(x)+xf(x)) = x+f(x)+xf(x).\\]\" width=\"324\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/5/7f5a2e024270b75b55fabd7e4b2232b4c3efab3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(s) = s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/8/418ddd7a15dceb57f56ad34a610f3471fefdb7ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = x+f(x)+xf(x).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"176\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Note: If we can show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is always <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ced6b9b2e75857b566f1e516560c4a4d63977299.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> we will get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/8/c18ab56b6470c9735d696fee40e979cdeba34e14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+f(x)+xf(x) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"171\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> and therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/9/429c9c2770acd6929f7ab1859edc65660d347ebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\frac{-x}{x+1}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"112\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a468c406b22c7e18313da7e2a3d99de0cd18b12e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(s)=s.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" /> Setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/f/51f2513e4a47abf30a92be69460d70d1e7e6f660.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y=s,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"13\" /> we get \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/1/6b197c96f84e84df6d454e0abad726ba098e1e74.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(s + f(s) + sf(s)) = f(2s + s^2) = 2s+s^2.\\]\" width=\"341\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/4/5e438dc33aa7f916307967cefd0264d1d2f9fcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=2s+s^2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/2/15223a8edd6673231529a6b6cc25b36fd7f2468e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(t)=t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\" /> as well.\n</p><p>Consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/a/f7aa6c6fe0f71f1444486e963503e07e3e8ae8bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s &gt; 0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" /> We get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/2/9c2c731606b273bc3c6db52ab75b75b5921a86ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 2s + s^2 &gt; s.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/2/ed204d61675fd60a9f58e0ee455ae4e146b8dfb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{f(x)}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"41\" height=\"40\" /> is strictly increasing for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e28efa00c4f2c66d1aa381c0cb1f8e0ef8d6e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/a/4faff9cd555ff913a0103bfeef0775112a0d397f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t &gt; s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> in this domain, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/b/cbb10ca63f179d613cc0a85f6c6bc5b5d4710a11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{f(t)}{t} &gt; \\frac{f(s)}{s}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"40\" /> but since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/5/7f5a2e024270b75b55fabd7e4b2232b4c3efab3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(s) = s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc3fb02d0c2d5cd43e4845d22e0b55854d13111d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(t) = t,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> we also have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/1/781f95c4b96a19f82503b4cb671fbe9ad8c812b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{f(s)}{s} = 1 = \\frac{f(t)}{t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"40\" /> which is a contradiction. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/6/2c6eabdb30c51f5745e1a97edc8556e75cbe18fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s \\leq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/0/a906ead5dc28c76bbdceda0e17fe30de2f5b5903.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1 &lt; s &lt; 0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" /> Using a similar argument, we will get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/9/9f9da59f70ed5bcb66046dbaa386984a51b9a958.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 2s + s^2 &lt; s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" /> but also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/9/d597b91bc06c7c379c5e52a603de6e53a40967e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{f(s)}{s} = 1 = \\frac{f(t)}{t},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"138\" height=\"40\" /> which is a contradiction.\n</p><p>Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/4/604c735470dd0152ca1cff75fe26eadf5cef7f49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/e/b7e410972975967ac67f697485c294856bb41bef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" /> we can conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/8/c18ab56b6470c9735d696fee40e979cdeba34e14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+f(x)+xf(x) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"171\" height=\"20\" /> and therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/1/621ab8624729151b51d8cfcf397deefaf9146406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\frac{-x}{x+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"107\" height=\"39\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO\" title=\"1994 IMO\">1994 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1994 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1994 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1994 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017142901\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 260/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8171/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.860      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    6.860      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:25391:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017142901 and revision id 205206. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}